WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.720
Narrator: Football has lost too many fans in crowds.

2
00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:06.980
Narrator: Every one of those disasters was preventable.

3
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:14.560
Narrator: Today you'll learn what went wrong, how to read a crowd, and why your smallest report can save lives.

